              "marks": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "1c",
              "text": "Two discrete time systems with impulse responses $h_1[n] = \\delta[n-1]$ and $h_2[n] = \\delta[n-2]$ are connected in cascade. The overall impulse response of the cascaded system is ______.",
              "marks": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "1d",
              "text": "For a periodic signal $v(t) = 30\\sin 100t + 10\\cos 300t + 6\\sin(500t + \\pi/4)$ the fundamental frequency in rad/s is ______.",
              "marks": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "1e",
              "text": "A discrete time system has impulse response $h[n] = 2^n u(n-4)$. Write 'Yes' if the system is stable or 'No' if the system is not stable. ______",
              "marks": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "1f",
              "text": "The impulse response of a system is $h(t) = t u(t)$. For an input of $u(t-2)$ the output is ______.",
              "marks": 2
